 Discouraged, i read more of the spoiler. From weap-341.txt:

    	"Hitting directly with a launcher ... or using a polearm at close
    range (unless mounted) causes only d2 damage (zero against shades)
    and does not exercise your weapon skill."

So now my wizard is in a bit of a bind. I did manage to get polearms to
skilled, but it was counter-productive trying to hit everything exactly
two squares away on the vert/horiz axis.  

Does this seem appropriate? ONLY d2 damage? Maybe a -3hit/-2dam penalty,
or better yet a -1hit/+2dam bonus when applied in the proper range, but
i digress. 

